<speak>Yes, I understand. If interest rates rise, the bonds held by the fund can fall in value, and my units can be worth less. Let me put my pen down for a moment. I tend to write while someone is talking and then discover I have written half a sentence in very poor handwriting. My notebook is supposed to make things easier, not become another thing to decipher afterwards. I have started leaving more space between entries. At least then I can add an ordinary reminder later without squeezing it into the margin.</speak>